{
  "schema_version": 3,
  "diagram_type": "lifecycle",
  "meta": {
    "title": "beautifulgo — Runtime Lifecycle",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "output": "runtime-lifecycle.lifecycle.html"
  },
  "mainPath": [
    "boot",
    "wire",
    "serve",
    "ready",
    "flow"
  ],
  "states": [
    {
      "id": "boot",
      "type": "start",
      "label": "config.Load",
      "sublabel": "typed env",
      "step": "01",
      "tag": "entry"
    },
    {
      "id": "wire",
      "type": "active",
      "label": "wire depgraph",
      "sublabel": "pgxpool · Register",
      "step": "02"
    },
    {
      "id": "serve",
      "type": "active",
      "label": "http serve",
      "sublabel": ":8080 bind",
      "step": "03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ready",
      "type": "decision",
      "label": "readyz gate",
      "sublabel": "SELECT 1 · 2s",
      "step": "04",
      "tag": "gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow",
      "type": "success",
      "label": "Steady state",
      "sublabel": "steady state",
      "step": "05",
      "tag": "done"
    },
    {
      "id": "gatefail",
      "type": "waiting",
      "label": "402/403 gate",
      "sublabel": "401 · 403 gates",
      "tag": "pause"
    },
    {
      "id": "drain",
      "type": "active",
      "label": "Outbox drain",
      "sublabel": "claim CTE · backoff",
      "tag": "automatic"
    },
    {
      "id": "exitfail",
      "type": "failure",
      "label": "Exit 1",
      "sublabel": "fail-closed boot",
      "tag": "terminal"
    },
    {
      "id": "degraded",
      "type": "failure",
      "label": "503 degraded",
      "sublabel": "pool down",
      "tag": "terminal"
    },
    {
      "id": "recovered",
      "type": "success",
      "label": "Sent · purged",
      "sublabel": "janitor + mark_sent",
      "tag": "terminal"
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "from": "boot",
      "to": "wire"
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "from": "wire",
      "to": "serve"
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "from": "serve",
      "to": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "from": "ready",
      "to": "flow"
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "from": "serve",
      "to": "gatefail",
      "variant": "security"
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "from": "ready",
      "to": "degraded",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "label": "DB down"
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "from": "flow",
      "to": "drain"
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "from": "drain",
      "to": "recovered",
      "variant": "emphasis"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Boot rail",
      "items": [
        "cmd/api never migrates — two replicas would race a startup migration; goose runs as a separate deployment step (go tool goose / migrate-up)",
        "boot order is sequential: config → pgxpool → adapters → middleware chain → each slice's Register(mux, deps) → graceful ListenAndServe (SIGINT/SIGTERM drains)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Gates + streams",
      "items": [
        "RequireAuth answers 401 envelopes AUTH_TOKEN_INVALID; RequireRole(Admin) raises the floor with rolex.AtLeast — /healthz and /readyz sit outside the middleware",
        "WS auth happens after the handshake: a bad ?token= closes 4001 authentication_failed before any upgrade completes; SSE teardown rides r.Context()",
        "shutdown drains in-flight handlers, then cancels baseCtx so SSE/WS pumps see ctx.Done()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Explicit endings",
      "items": [
        "readyz pings the pool with a 2s timeout and answers a 503 {degraded} envelope — since migrations never run at startup, drift shows up here, loudly",
        "config validation at boot fails in 200ms (required keys, known placeholder refusal) rather than at first use"
      ]
    }
  ]
}